        {
          "id": "AC-07.2.2",
          "title": "Certificate of residence is asked only of daily returners",
          "given": "an employee living in Germany has said they return daily",
          "when": "the employee continues the cross-border questions",
          "then": "the employee must say whether they have provided a certificate of residence: yes, no or not yet. 'Not yet' is a valid answer. No document is uploaded in Lonio; the certificate goes to HR outside Lonio. The answer is recorded for the tariff code and for HR, so HR knows when a certificate is still outstanding. Employees who do not return daily are not asked.",
          "examples": [
