          "given": "an employee living in Germany has said they do not return daily",
          "when": "the employee continues the cross-border questions",
          "then": "the employee must say whether a daily return would in principle be reasonable (less than 100 km driving distance), yes or no. Only if it is reasonable must they also say whether they expect more than 60 work-related non-return days in the calendar year, yes or no. This is a declaration of what they expect for the year; no proof is asked.",
